SECURITY DISCLAIMER
===================

This software is provided "as-is" for educational and personal use. While
designed with security best practices in mind, it makes no guarantees about
data integrity or protection against all attack vectors.

Users are responsible for:
1. Understanding the limitations outlined in the README.md security model
2. Using strong, unique passwords with bcrypt hashing
3. Securing their browser environment (antivirus, no malicious extensions)
4. Regularly backing up exported data
5. Reviewing the SQLite trigger-based budget calculation logic

The authors assume no liability for data loss, theft, or misuse resulting
from improper setup, weak security practices, or browser compromise.

For security questions or vulnerability reports, please review the code
and schema definitions thoroughly before deployment in production.
